% Scenario: a stroke's outline fills as the stroke, with round joins.
% Page 1 fills the outline strokepath leaves of a path 30 wide turning
% through 60 degrees with round joins (PLRM3 §8.2 strokepath,
% setlinejoin); page 2 strokes the same path. Both paint the same area.
/path { 120 150 moveto 420 150 lineto 270 410 lineto } def
30 setlinewidth 1 setlinejoin
path strokepath fill
showpage
30 setlinewidth 1 setlinejoin
path stroke
showpage
